# This directory is the MetaCan web application served at metacan.xera.ac.
#
# deploy/deploy.sh finds the app by looking for this marker file, never by a
# hard-coded path. That is deliberate: the research repo is being reorganized,
# and this directory can be renamed or moved without breaking the deploy, as
# long as the marker travels with it.
#
# Exactly one tracked .metacan-app may exist in the repo. If there are none, or
# more than one, the deploy stops and says so rather than guessing.
